A11Y / THEME / UNITS (ADR-015)
  - Every action carries an accessible name: the Refresh buttons surface the panel-specific aria-label
    (drivers.refresh / invitations.refresh) via Modifier.semantics; the Invite button surfaces invitations.create;
    the remove / revoke / copy icon buttons take drivers.remove / invitations.revoke / invitations.copyLink as
    their contentDescription. The shared IconButton enforces the ≥48 dp Material touch target.
  - Colours/typography come from MaterialTheme (P1/S9 tokens) — dark + dynamic colour honoured; no hardcoded
    colours (the destructive icon tints use colorScheme.error; the section-icon tint uses colorScheme.primary).
  - Panels always render a non-blank surface (DataTable or EmptyState); the page is Compose-native — no webview,
    no charts/maps (the web page has none). The expires timestamp is localised at the display boundary only.

